      "id": "caption-0",
      "startMs": 60,
      "endMs": 4664,
      "text": "一个想法听起来不错，并不代表它已经可靠。",
      "highlightKeywords": []
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-1",
      "startMs": 4993,
      "endMs": 11723,
      "text": "我们可以先提出方案，再运行一次，观察结果，然后决定怎么改。",
      "highlightKeywords": []
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-2",
      "startMs": 12026,
      "endMs": 15274,
      "text": "关键是，每一轮都留下记录。",
      "highlightKeywords": []
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-3",
      "startMs": 15593,
      "endMs": 20350,
      "text": "如果结果没有改善，不要只重复同一种做法。",
      "highlightKeywords": []
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-4",
      "startMs": 20660,
      "endMs": 25506,
      "text": "把原来的方案保留下来，分出两条不同的尝试，",
      "highlightKeywords": []
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-5",
      "startMs": 25827,
      "endMs": 28509,
      "text": "用相同的标准比较它们。",
      "highlightKeywords": []
    }
  ]
